  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef double <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Platform_00042\">float64</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This standard AUTOSAR type shall follow the 64-bit binary interchange format according to IEEE 754-2008 with encoding parameters specified in chapter 3.6, table 3.5, column \"binary64\".</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_91001\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> VoidPtr <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Platform_91001\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Platform_91001]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Platform_91001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Platform_91001)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef void* <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Platform_91001\">VoidPtr</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This standard AUTOSAR type shall be a void pointer Note: This type shall be used for buffers that contain data returned to the caller.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_91002\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> ConstVoidPtr <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Platform_91002\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Platform_91002]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Platform_91002\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Platform_91002)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef const void* <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Platform_91002\">ConstVoidPtr</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This standard AUTOSAR type shall be a void pointer to const. Note: This type shall be used for buffers that are passed to the callee.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00064\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> CPU_TYPE <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Platform_00064\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Platform_00064]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Platform_00064\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Platform_00064)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This symbol shall be defined as #define having one of the values CPU_TYPE_8, CPU_TYPE_16, CPU_TYPE_32 or CPU_TYPE_64 according to the platform.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00038\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> CPU_BIT_ORDER <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Platform_00038\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Platform_00038]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Platform_00038\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Platform_00038)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This symbol shall be defined as #define having one of the values MSB_FIRST or LSB_FIRST according to the platform.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00039\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> CPU_BYTE_ORDER <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Platform_00039\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Platform_00039]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Platform_00039\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Platform_00039, S. 26)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This symbol shall be defined as #define having one of the values HIGH_BYTE_FIRST or LOW_ BYTE_FIRST according to the platform.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00056\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> TRUE_FALSE <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Platform_00056\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Platform_00056]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Platform_00056\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_PlatformTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Platform_00056)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The symbols TRUE and FALSE shall be defined as follows: #ifndef TRUE #define TRUE 1 #endif #ifndef FALSE #define FALSE 0 #endif</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
 ]
}
